{"seq":1,"slug":"experiment-design-principles","title":"实验设计原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/ab-testing-statistics/experiment-design/experiment-design-principles","wordCount":1520,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"实验设计原则\">实验设计原则</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>A/B 测试的实验设计是连接业务假设和统计结论的桥梁。一个设计良好的实验能够在最短时间内以最小样本量获得可靠的因果推断结论；而设计不当的实验即使运行再长时间也可能得出错误的结论。实验设计的核心是在内部效度（因果推断的可靠性）、外部效度（结论的泛化能力）和实验效率（时间和资源成本）之间取得平衡。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[实验设计流程] --&gt; B[业务假设]&#10;    B --&gt; C[指标定义]&#10;    C --&gt; D[实验单元选择]&#10;    D --&gt; E[随机化方案]&#10;    E --&gt; F[样本量计算]&#10;    F --&gt; G[实验时长确定]&#10;    G --&gt; H[启动实验]&#10;    H --&gt; I[数据收集与监控]&#10;    I --&gt; J[统计分析]&#10;    J --&gt; K[结论与决策]&#10;    K --&gt; L[全量发布/迭代]\">graph TD\n    A[实验设计流程] --&gt; B[业务假设]\n    B --&gt; C[指标定义]\n    C --&gt; D[实验单元选择]\n    D --&gt; E[随机化方案]\n    E --&gt; F[样本量计算]\n    F --&gt; G[实验时长确定]\n    G --&gt; H[启动实验]\n    H --&gt; I[数据收集与监控]\n    I --&gt; J[统计分析]\n    J --&gt; K[结论与决策]\n    K --&gt; L[全量发布/迭代]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设计要素</th>\n<th>核心问题</th>\n<th>错误后果</th>\n<th>关键原则</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>假设明确</td>\n<td>测试什么？预期效果多大？</td>\n<td>实验无方向，无法判断成功</td>\n<td>一个实验一个主假设</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指标选择</td>\n<td>用什么衡量效果？</td>\n<td>指标不灵敏或与业务脱节</td>\n<td>主指标+护栏指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实验单元</td>\n<td>对谁随机化？</td>\n<td>单元泄漏导致偏差</td>\n<td>最小独立单元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机化</td>\n<td>如何分配处理组？</td>\n<td>分组不均衡引入混淆</td>\n<td>完全随机或分层随机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>样本量</td>\n<td>需要多少样本？</td>\n<td>样本不足检测不出效果</td>\n<td>功效分析确定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时长</td>\n<td>实验运行多久？</td>\n<td>太短有偏差，太长浪费资源</td>\n<td>覆盖完整业务周期</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实验设计的根本目标是隔离处理效应（Treatment Effect）——排除一切混淆因素后，精确衡量实验变量（处理）对目标指标（结果）的因果影响。费雪的随机化原则和 Neyman 的潜在结果框架是现代实验设计的两大理论基石。</p>\n<h2 id=\"假设与指标体系\">假设与指标体系</h2><p>实验假设应当遵循 SMART 原则：具体（Specific）、可衡量（Measurable）、可实现（Achievable）、相关（Relevant）和有时限（Time-bound）。一个好的假设应当明确指出&quot;改变 X 将导致 Y 指标提升 Z%&quot;。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from dataclasses import dataclass&#10;from typing import List, Optional&#10;from enum import Enum&#10;&#10;class MetricType(Enum):&#10;    PRIMARY = &#39;primary&#39;&#10;    SECONDARY = &#39;secondary&#39;&#10;    GUARDRAIL = &#39;guardrail&#39;&#10;&#10;@dataclass&#10;class ExperimentMetric:&#10;    name: str&#10;    metric_type: MetricType&#10;    description: str&#10;    expected_effect: Optional[float] = None&#10;    minimum_detectable_effect: Optional[float] = None&#10;    direction: str = &#39;increase&#39;&#10;&#10;@dataclass&#10;class ExperimentDesign:&#10;    name: str&#10;    hypothesis: str&#10;    metrics: List[ExperimentMetric]&#10;    experiment_unit: str&#10;    traffic_allocation: float&#10;    target_population: str&#10;    exclusion_criteria: List[str]&#10;&#10;    def validate(self):&#10;        issues = []&#10;&#10;        primary_metrics = [m for m in self.metrics if m.metric_type == MetricType.PRIMARY]&#10;        if len(primary_metrics) != 1:&#10;            issues.append(f&quot;Should have exactly 1 primary metric, found {len(primary_metrics)}&quot;)&#10;&#10;        guardrail_metrics = [m for m in self.metrics if m.metric_type == MetricType.GUARDRAIL]&#10;        if len(guardrail_metrics) == 0:&#10;            issues.append(&quot;Should have at least 1 guardrail metric&quot;)&#10;&#10;        if self.traffic_allocation &gt; 0.5:&#10;            issues.append(&quot;Traffic allocation &gt;50% is risky for new features&quot;)&#10;&#10;        return issues\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dataclasses </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dataclass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> typing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> List, Optional</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> enum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Enum</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MetricType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Enum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    PRIMARY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'primary'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    SECONDARY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'secondary'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    GUARDRAIL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'guardrail'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@dataclass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ExperimentMetric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    metric_type: MetricType</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    description: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    expected_effect: Optional[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    minimum_detectable_effect: Optional[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    direction: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'increase'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@dataclass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ExperimentDesign</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    hypothesis: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    metrics: List[ExperimentMetric]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    experiment_unit: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    traffic_allocation: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    target_population: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    exclusion_criteria: List[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> validate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        issues </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        primary_metrics </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.metrics </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m.metric_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MetricType.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">PRIMARY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(primary_metrics) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            issues.append(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Should have exactly 1 primary metric, found </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(primary_metrics)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        guardrail_metrics </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.metrics </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m.metric_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MetricType.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">GUARDRAIL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(guardrail_metrics) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            issues.append(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Should have at least 1 guardrail metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.traffic_allocation </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            issues.append(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Traffic allocation >50</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">% i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">s risky for new features\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> issues</span></span></code></pre></div><p>指标体系通常分为三层：主指标（Primary Metric）是实验的核心判断依据，每个实验应当且仅当有一个主指标——多个主指标会引入多重比较问题，降低统计功效。次要指标（Secondary Metric）提供补充洞察，帮助理解主指标变化的机制。护栏指标（Guardrail Metric）监控实验是否产生负面影响，如页面加载时间、崩溃率等——即使主指标提升，如果护栏指标显著恶化，实验也应当终止。</p>\n<p>OEC（Overall Evaluation Criterion）是将多个指标综合为单一评判标准的方法。微软的实验平台使用加权 OEC 来平衡用户参与度、收入和性能等多个维度的指标。OEC 的权重设计需要业务判断，且应当在实验前确定，不能在看到结果后调整。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标层次</th>\n<th>数量</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主指标</td>\n<td>1 个</td>\n<td>实验成功的判断依据</td>\n<td>转化率、日活用户数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>次要指标</td>\n<td>2-5 个</td>\n<td>理解效果机制</td>\n<td>点击率、浏览深度、留存率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>护栏指标</td>\n<td>2-3 个</td>\n<td>监控负面影响</td>\n<td>页面加载时间、错误率、退订率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据质量指标</td>\n<td>1-2 个</td>\n<td>验证实验健康</td>\n<td>样本比率、Cookie 冲突率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实验单元与流量分配\">实验单元与流量分配</h2><p>实验单元（Experiment Unit）是随机化分配的最小单位。选择合适的实验单元直接影响实验的内部效度。最常见的实验单元是用户（User），但根据场景不同，也可能选择会话（Session）、设备（Device）、页面访问（Page View）或地理区域（Geo Region）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import hashlib&#10;import numpy as np&#10;&#10;def assign_user_to_group(user_id, experiment_id, n_groups=2, salt=&#39;&#39;):&#10;    hash_input = f&quot;{experiment_id}_{salt}_{user_id}&quot;&#10;    hash_value = hashlib.md5(hash_input.encode()).hexdigest()&#10;    bucket = int(hash_value[:8], 16) % 10000&#10;&#10;    group_size = 10000 // n_groups&#10;    group = bucket // group_size&#10;&#10;    return min(group, n_groups - 1)&#10;&#10;def check_sample_ratio_mismatch(control_count, treatment_count,&#10;                                  expected_ratio=0.5, alpha=0.05):&#10;    from scipy.stats import chi2&#10;&#10;    total = control_count + treatment_count&#10;    expected_control = total * (1 - expected_ratio)&#10;    expected_treatment = total * expected_ratio&#10;&#10;    chi2_stat = ((control_count - expected_control) ** 2 / expected_control +&#10;                 (treatment_count - expected_treatment) ** 2 / expected_treatment)&#10;&#10;    p_value = 1 - chi2.cdf(chi2_stat, df=1)&#10;&#10;    actual_ratio = treatment_count / total&#10;&#10;    return {&#10;        &#39;chi2_statistic&#39;: chi2_stat,&#10;        &#39;p_value&#39;: p_value,&#10;        &#39;is_mismatch&#39;: p_value &lt; alpha,&#10;        &#39;expected_ratio&#39;: expected_ratio,&#10;        &#39;actual_ratio&#39;: actual_ratio,&#10;        &#39;deviation&#39;: abs(actual_ratio - expected_ratio)&#10;    }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hashlib</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> assign_user_to_group</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user_id, experiment_id, n_groups</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, salt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    hash_input </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">experiment_id</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">_</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">salt</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">_</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    hash_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hashlib.md5(hash_input.encode()).hexdigest()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bucket </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(hash_value[:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    group_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10000</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> //</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_groups</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    group </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bucket </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> group_size</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(group, n_groups </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> check_sample_ratio_mismatch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(control_count, treatment_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                                  expected_ratio</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scipy.stats </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chi2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> control_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> treatment_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    expected_control </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expected_ratio)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    expected_treatment </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expected_ratio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    chi2_stat </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ((control_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expected_control) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expected_control </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                 (treatment_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expected_treatment) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expected_treatment)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    p_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chi2.cdf(chi2_stat, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">df</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    actual_ratio </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> treatment_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'chi2_statistic'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: chi2_stat,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'p_value'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: p_value,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'is_mismatch'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: p_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alpha,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'expected_ratio'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: expected_ratio,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'actual_ratio'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: actual_ratio,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'deviation'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(actual_ratio </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expected_ratio)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span></code></pre></div><p>样本比率不匹配（Sample Ratio Mismatch, SRM）是实验可靠性的第一道检查。如果实验组和对照组的实际样本比例与预期比例显著偏离，说明实验的随机化过程出了问题——可能是代码 bug、用户过滤逻辑差异或日志丢失等原因。SRM 是实验结果不可信的强烈信号，必须先排查 SRM 才能解读实验结果。</p>\n<p>流量分配策略需要考虑风险和效率的平衡。对于高风险变更（如核心算法替换），通常从 1% → 5% → 10% → 50% 逐步放量；对于低风险变更（如 UI 微调），可以直接 50/50 分配。多实验并行时，需要正交流量层（Orthogonal Traffic Layer）确保不同实验的随机化独立。</p>\n<h2 id=\"效应量与最小可检测效应\">效应量与最小可检测效应</h2><p>最小可检测效应（Minimum Detectable Effect, MDE）是实验能够以足够统计功效检测到的最小效应大小。MDE 的选择既是统计问题也是业务问题：太大的 MDE 意味着只能检测到大幅改进（可能错过有价值的小幅改进），太小的 MDE 需要巨大的样本量。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from scipy.stats import norm&#10;import numpy as np&#10;&#10;def compute_mde(baseline_rate, n_per_group, alpha=0.05, power=0.8):&#10;    z_alpha = norm.ppf(1 - alpha / 2)&#10;    z_beta = norm.ppf(power)&#10;&#10;    se = np.sqrt(2 * baseline_rate * (1 - baseline_rate) / n_per_group)&#10;    mde = (z_alpha + z_beta) * se&#10;&#10;    return {&#10;        &#39;mde_absolute&#39;: mde,&#10;        &#39;mde_relative&#39;: mde / baseline_rate * 100,&#10;        &#39;baseline_rate&#39;: baseline_rate,&#10;        &#39;n_per_group&#39;: n_per_group,&#10;        &#39;alpha&#39;: alpha,&#10;        &#39;power&#39;: power&#10;    }&#10;&#10;def sensitivity_analysis(baseline_rate, n_options, alpha=0.05, power=0.8):&#10;    results = []&#10;    for n in n_options:&#10;        mde = compute_mde(baseline_rate, n, alpha, power)&#10;        results.append({&#10;            &#39;n_per_group&#39;: n,&#10;            &#39;mde_absolute&#39;: mde[&#39;mde_absolute&#39;],&#10;            &#39;mde_relative&#39;: mde[&#39;mde_relative&#39;]&#10;        })&#10;    return results\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scipy.stats </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> norm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> compute_mde</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(baseline_rate, n_per_group, alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, power</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    z_alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> norm.ppf(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    z_beta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> norm.ppf(power)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    se </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.sqrt(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> baseline_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> baseline_rate) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_per_group)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    mde </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (z_alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z_beta) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> se</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'mde_absolute'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: mde,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'mde_relative'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: mde </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> baseline_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'baseline_rate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: baseline_rate,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'n_per_group'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: n_per_group,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'alpha'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: alpha,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'power'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: power</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sensitivity_analysis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(baseline_rate, n_options, alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, power</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_options:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        mde </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> compute_mde(baseline_rate, n, alpha, power)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        results.append({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            'n_per_group'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: n,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            'mde_absolute'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: mde[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'mde_absolute'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            'mde_relative'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: mde[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'mde_relative'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results</span></span></code></pre></div><p>效应量（Effect Size）的标准化表示使得不同实验之间可以进行比较。Cohen&#39;s d 是连续指标的标准化效应量，d = 0.2 被视为小效应，d = 0.5 为中等效应，d = 0.8 为大效应。对于比率指标，相对提升百分比（Relative Lift）是更直观的效应量表达。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>效应量指标</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>小效应</th>\n<th>中效应</th>\n<th>大效应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Cohen&#39;s d</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(μ_1-μ_2)/σ</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class